#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0309 expect=noViolation domain=APMH
#note "Negative control: DOMAIN is APMH, 4 characters, which is what the rule requires of an Associated Persons dataset. Paired with the -invalid- twin so neither can pass vacuously."
dataset APMH label="Associated Persons Medical History"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col APID     type=Char label="Associated Persons Identifier"
col MHSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col MHTERM   type=Char label="Reported Term for the Medical History"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | APMH | AP-701-1015 | 1 | ASTHMA
CDISCPILOT01 | APMH | AP-701-1023 | 2 | ECZEMA
---
